<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50157" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vangĭŏnes</span></b> , um,
			m.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>a German people on the
				Rhine</i>, about the mod. <i>Worms</i>, <i><span class="en">Caes. B. G.
				1, 51</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 17, 31, § 106</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Tac. G.
				28</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. A. 12, 27</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. H. 4,
			70</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Luc. 1, 431</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Amm. 15, 11,
			8</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>the capital of the
				Vangiones</i>, now <i>Worms</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Amm. 15, 11, 8</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
